<rml>
<head>
    <title>Death</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="Base.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="DeathScreen.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- The death of the player (see UI::DeathScreen): the edges of the view darken, the eyelids close, then GAME OVER and
     how to restart on the black. The code moves all of it every frame (see Gameplay::PlayerDeath for the times). -->
<body>
    <img id="vignette" src="Images/VignetteDeath.png"/>
    <img class="eyelid" id="eyelid-top" src="Images/Eyelid.png"/>
    <img class="eyelid" id="eyelid-bottom" src="Images/Eyelid.png"/>
    <div id="black"></div>
    <div id="message">
        <div id="title-box">
            <img id="title-glow" src="Images/TitleGlow.png"/>
            <img id="title" src="Images/GameOver.png"/>
        </div>
        <div id="hint">PRESS ANY KEY TO RESTART</div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
